<title>BELGIUM: EU confirms clears Allianz buy of Vereinte.</title>
<headline>EU confirms clears Allianz buy of Vereinte.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had cleared the proposed buy of German insurance firm Vereinte Holding AG by Allianz AG.</p>
<p>In a statement, the Commission said the deal &quot;could not be expected to lead to the creation of a dominant position.&quot;</p>
<p>Earlier, Germany's cartel office said it had approved the planned deal.</p>
<p>The Commission last month cleared the acquisition of control of Hermes Kreditversicherungs AG by Allianz.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
</text>
